274
00:12:43,897 --> 00:12:45,366
♪ Get on board ♪

275
00:12:45,399 --> 00:12:50,104
♪ We're gonna ride till
there ain't no more to go ♪

276
00:12:50,137 --> 00:12:53,941
-♪ Takin' it slow ♪
-♪ Takin' it slow ♪

277
