472
00:20:34,334 --> 00:20:35,803
Oh, yeah, I double up.
I got it, I got it, I got it.

473
00:20:35,837 --> 00:20:37,972
(strumming intro)

474
00:20:38,005 --> 00:20:39,607
(harmonizing):
